          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A model equipped with mega armour improves its Armour Save to 2+, increases its Bulky value by +1 (minimum Bulky (2)), gains the Firing Protocols (2) special rule, gains +1 Wound, and reduces its Movement and Initiative Characteristics by −1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
