      <rules>
        <rule name="Dok's Tools" id="5ee5-60bd-015c-1965" hidden="false">
          <description>Friendly Ork Infantry units joined by a Painboss gain Feel No Pain (5+). If the unit already possesses Feel No Pain, improve that roll by +1 to a maximum of Feel No Pain (4+).</description>
