        <rule name="Lumbering Charge" id="2b89-cf03-6253-2bbe" hidden="false">
          <description>Units with this special rule gain +2 to Charge rolls. In addition, units with this special rule ignore penalties applied to Charge rolls due to reduced Movement Characteristics.</description>
