    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Deff Dread" hidden="false" id="fcb0-ef3f-aade-d944" publicationId="96d0-c462-d158-fbad">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Unstable Mech'" id="ef7b-13f4-52f1-bcb2" hidden="false">
          <description>At the beginning of each controlling player turn, roll a D6. On a roll of 1, the Deff Dread suffers a Strength 8 AP2 hit with the Breaching (6+) special rule. On a roll of 2–5, select one of the following effects until the beginning of the next turn: Rampage (3) Hammer of Wrath (3) Sudden Strike (2) Fleet (2) Rage (3) Dakka! (5+) On a roll of 6, select any two of the above effects.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
